Janis, I'm surprised--you're a regular here, surely you understand that
people sometimes attempt oddball conducts?  (I seem to recall hearing
about someone who used a wooden box as his only weapon...!)  The
question was, is MC as important as MR?  David said it wasn't, since
people regularly ascend with MC2; I was pointing out that MC2 is
*still* MC, and I've never seen someone attempt an ascension without
any MC at all.  It seems possible, but it would have its own
challenges.  My point was that David's argument is a weak one, at best;
he would've been better off pointing out the insta-kill possibility of
not having MR, vs. the lack of such a possibility with no MC (as you
have).  The real challenges of avoiding MC, in my opinion, seem to come
from not having the other effects of MC-granting equipment.

> What would happen without MC? All attacks that come to my
